<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amlac buys three paint operations.</title>
<headline>Amlac buys three paint operations.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amlac Ltd said on Thursday it had bought the net assets and operations of three of the paint-related branches of Walter McNaughtan's Ltd with effect from May 1 and June 1.</p>
<p>It gave no purchase price in the brief statement.</p>
<p>It said the pro-forma effect of the acquisition on Amlac's earnings for the six months to June 30, 1996 was an increase of 1.3 cents per share.</p>
<p>Further details of the purchases would be given in the annual financial statements to be published towards the end of this month.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
